## Advanced: Custom Data Formatting

If your query returns data in a shape that doesn't match the chart requirements, use the `formatter` function:

```typescript
{
  id: "custom-format",
  title: "Custom Question",
  type: "bar_chart",
  query: () => `SELECT product_id, review_count FROM analytics_cache`,
  formatter: (rawData) => {
    // Transform data to { name, value } format
    return rawData.map(row => ({
      name: `Product ${row.product_id}`,
      value: row.review_count,
    }));
  },
  chartConfig: {
    dataKey: "value",
    nameKey: "name",
  }
}
```

