When adding a new analytics question:

- [ ] **Schema validation**: Verified all tables and columns exist in database
- [ ] **Check TASKS.md**: Confirmed feature is implemented (if querying feature-specific tables)
- [ ] SQL query tested in Supabase SQL Editor
- [ ] Query returns expected column names (`name`, `value` for charts)
- [ ] Appropriate collection identified (or new collection created)
- [ ] `QuestionConfig` object created with unique `id`
- [ ] Added to collection's questions array
- [ ] `chartConfig` or `metricConfig` provided for visualization type
- [ ] Date range parameter used if time-based filtering is needed
- [ ] Question renders without errors in dev environment
- [ ] Question appears in correct collection tab
- [ ] Question is searchable by title
- [ ] Data is meaningful and actionable for business users

